Phonon for iPhone
https://github.com/abhaymettu/phonon-ios

This is a port of Phonon (https://github.com/Infatoshi/phonon) by Elliot Arledge and
contributors, to iOS. It was written in the ios/ folder of Phonon on top of upstream commit
2e9a5b724845b7b5881701f06c08d00deccc3e5f and is offered back to Phonon as a pull request.
The refiner prompt, token budget, word-count guard and term restore in
PhononCore/Sources/PhononCore/RefinerPrompt.swift are ported from Phonon's
sidecar/polish_server.py.

